+ cmp_oc_a cmp_neg_a cmp_oc_b cmp_neg_b ib_sf_oa ib_sf_na ib_sf_ob ib_sf_nb VDDA VDD VSS r1_safe
* oscillator enable held high by a tie cell (as try e)
XU_TIE_OSC osc_en VDD VSS sg13g2_tiehi
XU_OSC osc_en osc_trim0 osc_trim1 osc_trim2 osc_trim3 osc_trim4 osc_clk VDD VSS r1_osc
* PENDING-IN-LAYOUT: the whole r1_adc (placeholder r1_adc_ph); pin list of the placeholder + cur_trk (testbench)
XU_ADC adc_hold is_smp osc_clk adc_start adc_sel adc_valid_a
+ adc_raw_a0 adc_raw_a1 adc_raw_a2 adc_raw_a3 adc_raw_a4 adc_raw_a5 adc_raw_a6 adc_raw_a7 adc_raw_a8 adc_raw_a9 adc_raw_a10 adc_raw_a11 adc_raw_a12 adc_raw_a13
