XU_GATE pwm_a pwm_b pwm_c VDD gate_a_c2p gate_b_c2p gate_c_c2p VDD gate_vdda_nc VSS r1_gate_lv
Rgate_vdda_nc gate_vdda_nc VSS 1e12

